*   **Time Complexity**: $O(n \cdot k_{max})$. Since $k_{max} \approx 316$ and $n \le 50000$, operations are $\approx 1.5 \times 10^7$, which is well within limits.
*   **Space Complexity**: $O(n)$ for the frequency array and auxiliary structures.

